# College ERP System - Backend API TODO

Node.js/Express REST API with MongoDB

**Tech Stack:** Node.js, Express, MongoDB, Mongoose, JWT, Passport.js

---

## API Infrastructure

### Server & Configuration
- [x] Express server setup with TypeScript
- [x] CORS configuration
- [x] Security middleware (Helmet.js)
- [x] Request logging (Morgan)
- [x] Environment variables (.env)
- [x] MongoDB connection with Mongoose
- [x] Passport.js configuration
- [x] Global error handling middleware
- [x] 404 handler middleware

### Testing
- [x] Bun test framework setup
- [x] Test helpers and utilities
- [x] Mock request/response utilities
- [x] Authentication controller tests
- [x] Department management tests
- [x] Course management tests
- [x] Student management tests
- [x] Faculty management tests
- [x] Enrollment tests
- [x] Attendance tests
- [x] Integration tests with real database
  - [x] mongodb-memory-server setup
  - [x] Database fixtures and seeders
  - [x] Setup/teardown utilities
- [x] E2E API tests
  - [x] Express server test utilities
  - [x] HTTP client for API requests
  - [x] Authentication E2E tests (22/22 passing)
  - [x] CRUD operations E2E tests (15/27 passing)

