## Authentication & Authorization

### Authentication (AUTH-001 to AUTH-005)
- [x] User Registration API
  - [x] POST /api/auth/register
  - [x] Email validation (unique check)
  - [x] Password minimum 8 characters
  - [x] Password hashing with bcrypt (12 rounds)
  - [x] Pending state requiring admin approval
- [x] User Login API
  - [x] POST /api/auth/login
  - [x] JWT token generation (access + refresh)
  - [x] Token expiration (1 hour access, 30 day refresh)
  - [x] Password reset flow (email)
- [x] Token Refresh API
  - [x] POST /api/auth/refresh
- [x] Logout API
  - [x] POST /api/auth/logout
  - [x] Audit logging
- [x] Get Current User API
  - [x] GET /api/auth/me
- [x] Change Password API
  - [x] POST /api/auth/change-password
  - [x] Current password verification
  - [x] Audit logging
- [x] Password Reset API
  - [x] POST /api/auth/forgot-password
  - [x] POST /api/auth/reset-password

### Authorization
- [x] JWT authentication middleware
- [x] Role-based authorization middleware
- [x] Six built-in roles: super_admin, admin, dept_head, faculty, staff, student
- [x] Server-side permission validation
- [x] Permission format: resource:action
- [x] User approval status checking in JWT authentication
- [x] Role inheritance
- [x] Custom role creation API
- [x] Admin session revocation

