## Database Collections

- [x] Users - `{ email, passwordHash, role, status, departmentId, mustChangePassword, approvedAt, approvedBy, rejectionReason }`
- [x] Students - `{ userId, rollNumber, departmentId, batch, semester }`
- [x] Faculty - `{ userId, departmentId, specialization, designation }`
- [x] Departments - `{ name, code (unique) }`
- [x] Courses - `{ name, code, departmentId, credits, description, prerequisites, level, elective }`
- [x] Terms - `{ name, startDate, endDate, status }`
- [x] CourseOfferings - `{ courseId, termId, capacity, status }`
- [x] OfferingFaculty - `{ offeringId, facultyId, role }`
- [x] Sessions - `{ offeringId, date, startTime, endTime, location, status }`
- [x] Enrollments - `{ studentId, offeringId, status, enrolledAt, droppedAt }`
- [x] AttendanceRecords - `{ sessionId, studentId, status, remarks, markedBy, markedAt }`
- [x] AuditLogs - `{ actorUserId, action, targetType, targetId, status, metadata, ipAddress, createdAt }`
- [x] CustomRoles - `{ name, permissions, createdBy }`

